  "contentHtml": "<p></p><table Table\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184;mso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;   height:40.3pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"673\" style=\"width:504.55pt;border-top:solid #0F243E 2.25pt;   border-left:none;border-bottom:solid #0F243E 2.25pt;border-right:none;   padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:40.3pt\">\r\n  <p  align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;   word-break:keep-all\"><b><span  style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:   &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:굴림;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">2020</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:굴림;   color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">년 제<span >29</span>회 눈높이 교육상</span></b><span  style=\";font-family:굴림;mso-bidi-font-family:   굴림;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p  align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;mso-pagination:widow-orphan; word-break:keep-all\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family:굴림;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span><span  style=\";font-family:굴림;mso-bidi-font-family: 굴림;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p  align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;mso-pagination:widow-orphan; word-break:keep-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family:굴림;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">눈높이 교육상은 어려운 여건 속에서도 가르침의\r\n열정으로 묵묵히 교단을 지키는 선생님들의 노고에 힘이 되길</span><span  style=\";font-family:굴림;mso-bidi-font-family:굴림;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p  align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;mso-pagination:widow-orphan; word-break:keep-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family:굴림;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">바라는<span >&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:굴림;mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">마음에서 대교문화재단이<span >&nbsp;1992</span>년에 제정한 첫 번째 교육활동지원 사업입니다<span >.</span></span><span  style=\"; font-family:굴림;mso-bidi-font-family:굴림;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p  align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;mso-pagination:widow-orphan; word-break:keep-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family:굴림;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">올해로<span >&nbsp;29</span>년째\r\n진행되는 만큼 오랜 역사와 전통을 자랑하는 눈높이 교육상은 역대<span >&nbsp;200</span>명의 수상자를 배출하며<span >&nbsp;</span></span><span  style=\"; font-family:굴림;mso-bidi-font-family:굴림;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p  align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;mso-pagination:widow-orphan; word-break:keep-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family:굴림;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">국내<span >&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:굴림;mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">최대 규모의 교육상으로 자리 매김 하였습니다<span >.</span></span><span  style=\";font-family:굴림;mso-bidi-font-family:굴림; mso-font-kerning:0pt\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p  align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;mso-pagination:widow-orphan; word-break:keep-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family:굴림;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">사회에 귀감이 되는 이 시대의 참스승을\r\n발굴하고 있으니 교육자 분들의 많은 관심과 지원 부탁드립니다<span >.</span></span><span  style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:굴림;mso-bidi-font-family:굴림; color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext .75pt;padding:0cm 0cm 1.0pt 0cm\">\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%;layout-grid-mode: char;border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext .75pt;padding:0cm; mso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 1.0pt 0cm\"><span 